4,0,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
5,0,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play this with you all! Let's have a blast! Since we have a werewolf and a possessed among us, how should we figure out who's who? Any ideas?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"It's nice to meet you. I think we should start by observing how everyone reacts to each other. Since the Werewolf and Possessed will want to blend in, any inconsistencies in their logic might give them away.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I agree with Misaki. Observation and patience are our best tools. Let us listen carefully to one another and see what patterns emerge.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm excited too! Let's all just be honest and help each other out. If we trust each other, maybe we can find the werewolf together without anyone getting hurt! What do you think, Benjamin?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all as well. While Kenji's optimism is charming, I believe blind trust is a luxury we cannot afford. Logic and evidence must be our primary guides if we wish to survive.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mio,,"Wow, Benjamin is so serious! But he's right, we can't just trust everyone. Maybe we should all share our thoughts openly? Or would that be too dangerous? I wonder if the werewolf is hiding in the silence!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"Openness can be a double-edged sword. While it helps us share information, it also gives the Werewolf and Possessed a chance to tailor their lies to fit our theories. A balanced approach is likely best.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Silence can be a sanctuary for the truth, but also a shield for the deceptive. I believe we should speak only when we have something meaningful to contribute, avoiding unnecessary noise.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Jonathan, that sounds a bit lonely! I think if we talk more, we can get to know each other better and feel safer. I don't want anyone to feel left out while we're searching!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, safety is a comforting thought, but in this game, familiarity is often a mask. I agree with Misaki; excessive openness allows the wolves to adapt their narrative. We should prioritize quality of information over quantity.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mio,,"Hmm, quality over quantity, huh? That sounds so professional! But if we're too quiet, won't it be harder to spot someone acting weird? I say we keep the energy up! Who's feeling nervous right now?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'm not particularly nervous, but I think we should be careful not to let the energy distract us. If we focus too much on emotions, we might overlook the logical gaps I mentioned earlier.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Peace is found in the stillness. While energy has its place, let us not mistake activity for progress. I believe we will find our answers by observing the gaps in what is said, rather than the volume.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Jonathan, you're always so calm! But I'm actually a little nervous because I don't want any of my friends to be the werewolf. Let's just try to be kind to each other while we figure this out!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, kindness is a virtue, but let us not let it cloud our judgment. Emotional appeals are often the most effective tools for those wishing to deflect suspicion. Let us remain polite, yet analytically detached.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mio,,"Analytically detached! You guys are making this sound like a science experiment! I'll try my best to be a good subject, but I'm sticking with my gut! Let's see what happens tomorrow! Good luck everyone!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"Good luck to you too, Mio. I'll be watching and listening carefully. Let's hope we can find the truth tomorrow.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I wish you all a peaceful night. Let us reflect on today's words and see what the morning reveals.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Good luck everyone! I hope we all have sweet dreams and wake up feeling great tomorrow. Let's all do our best to stay safe!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, a restful night is a luxury, provided we wake up to a complete group. I shall spend my evening reflecting on our initial exchanges. Sleep well, everyone; may the truth reveal itself.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
28,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
